{"id":"n27805-1-11","stage":1,"title":"대사관 · 大使馆","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27805-1-11-1","ko":"여권은 왜 가지고 나오셨어요?","zh":"您为什么带着护照出来呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여권은","meaning":"护照","explanation":"여권：护照；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"여권","audio":"/audio/03ed7a436dd264d1c2ca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70992","senseId":"1","lemma":"여권","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여권은","audio":"/audio/17d144ebdc8c7a458813.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"가지고","meaning":"用，拿","explanation":"가지다：用，拿；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"가지다","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65234","senseId":"9","lemma":"가지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가지고","audio":"/audio/2e847f33430d128ed48a.mp3"}},{"text":"나오셨어요?","meaning":"来，出来","explanation":"나오다：来，出来；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"26","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나오셨어요","audio":"/audio/7209fe57b347dbf71475.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"03ed7a436dd264d1","term":"여권","zh":"护照","audio":"/audio/03ed7a436dd264d1c2ca.mp3","entryId":"70992","definition":"证明去他国旅行的人的身份或国籍，在旅行国家要求保护的文件。","pronunciation":["여꿘"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f3b684d86e5485ed","term":"가지다","zh":"用，拿","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3","entryId":"65234","definition":"把某物作为工具或材料、手段或方法。","pronunciation":["가지다"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"来，出来","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"抱着某种目的过来。","pronunciation":["나오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/6ba111fe5d97f922fc34.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n27805-1-11-2","ko":"비자를 받으러 대사관에 가려고요.","zh":"我打算去大使馆办理签证。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"비자를","meaning":"签证","explanation":"비자：签证；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"비자","audio":"/audio/01e3e74e2acfdb5a1488.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60707","senseId":"1","lemma":"비자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비자를","audio":"/audio/009c33c90b7d3fb76e2f.mp3"}},{"text":"받으러","meaning":"取得，获得","explanation":"받다：取得，获得；으러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"4","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받으러","audio":"/audio/20397dcefd390f4ef804.mp3"}},{"text":"대사관에","meaning":"大使馆","explanation":"대사관：大使馆；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"대사관","audio":"/audio/c481f43a24fc72996b3b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27805","senseId":"1","lemma":"대사관","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대사관에","audio":"/audio/d61c5cedf60ad4c740b3.mp3"}},{"text":"가려고요.","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；려고：非敬语地表达打算，或根据语调询问意图。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가려고요","audio":"/audio/043170a05ce101181469.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"01e3e74e2acfdb5a","term":"비자","zh":"签证","audio":"/audio/01e3e74e2acfdb5a1488.mp3","entryId":"60707","definition":"外国人的出入境许可证明。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"取得，获得","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"得到分数或学位等。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"c4